   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII FlatSpace Taylor Unit Tests\n\nFlatSpace-specific tests for TypeII Taylor:\n- matter fermion point-detection and derivatives\n- generic holo/anti-holo guards\n- FlatSpace exponential polynomials",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Remove[\"Global`*\"]\nNeeds[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"TypeII\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\" -> \"TypeII-Xi\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\"|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
